  "details": "VRChat's EAC specifically blocks execution in a virtual machine under Linux guests, while Windows guests are allowed and the docs do not mention that linux guests are explicitly blocked. My vm configuration is very typical and is attached linked as the upload is blocked. https://paste.debian.net/1410637/",
